  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like protection from arrows, except you divide the duration in 1-hour intervals among the creatures touched. Once the spell absorbs 10 points of damage per caster level (maximum 100 points) for a subject, the spell’s effects end for that subject.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions like protection from arrows, except you divide the duration in 1-hour intervals among the creatures touched. once the spell absorbs 10 points of damage per caster level (maximum 100 points) for a subject, the spell’s effects end for that subject.\"",
